<title>USA: Atmos Energy names Dagley CFO.</title>
<headline>Atmos Energy names Dagley CFO.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atmos Energy Corp said on Wednesday it named Larry Dagley executive vice president and chief financial officer, effective May 1.</p>
<p>Dagley, 48, joins Atmos from Pacific Enterprises, where he had been chief financial officer since 1995.</p>
<p>Dagley replaces James Purser, who resigned earlier this month.</p>
